window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>I thought I would have time to heal from the loss of Fenris and everything that happened in Germany. The world had different plans.</p> <p>After a mysterious phone call and a secret meeting, I need to get the help of my family to deal with what comes next. With two dead humans already, the unknown werecat that killed them must be tracked down and put down. There’s no coming back from the Last Change.</p> <p>With my heart still wounded from the loss of Fenris, I know I’m not ready for this. I don’t have a choice in the matter.</p>"; 
